Hi

I've made a patch that names the quantum mechanics and the erinyes. It
should be bonesfile safe.

I figured one of the main reasons that monsters don't come pre-named was
that the way of referring to monsters changed from "Peter the wolf bites!"
to "Peter bites!" several versions ago.  Having monsters with names pop up
out of nowhere is disconcerting and confusing, so the names were dropped
(from Quantum Mechanics).

This patch give some quantum mechanics names (old names plus a couple
more) and gives the first three erinyes names.  While the names are
unknown, you get a message like "The Quantum Mechanic hits!" If you #chat
with one with an unknown name, it introduces itself. After that you get
the message "Niels hits!"  You can also learn their names if you scan them
with telepathy (; or /).

Because of the kludge used to store unkown names, all unknown names vanish
when a bonesfile is created. Erinyes in the bonesfile are given a new name
when the file is loaded.

Here is the patch:
http://cec.wustl.edu/~naw1/qm_erinys_names.diff

